{"candidateAnswer":"Nike","evidence":"[D3:15 | 4:21 pm on 16 July, 2023] John: Thanks! The Nike and Gatorade deals have me stoked! I've always liked Under Armour, working with them would be really cool.\n[D25:2 | 10:04 am on 19 December, 2023] John: Yo Tim! Great to hear from you. Things have been wild! Last week I got this amazing deal with a renowned outdoor gear company. So pumped!","itemId":"urn:uuid:697a5ab4-16fa-541f-ba18-869368ba2ac2","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:5ab2bf59c5836b1b8c15b6cd2a06093f86d789cae041d93f3d7d5b51827b187a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which outdoor gear company likely signed up John for an endorsement deal?","referenceAnswer":"Under Armour","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"5ab2bf59c5836b1b8c15b6cd2a06093f86d789cae041d93f3d7d5b51827b187a"}}]}